<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Awareness of Nature</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #e6f7e6;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        header {
            background-color: #2e8b57;
            color: white;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        section {
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 20px;
            background-color: white;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 2px 2px 10px gray;
        }

        h2 {
            color: #2e8b57;
        }

        img {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 400px;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        .quote {
            font-style: italic;
            color: darkgreen;
        }

        footer {
            background-color: #2e8b57;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 10px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <h1>Awareness of Nature</h1>
    <p>Protect Nature, Protect Life 🌿</p>
</header>

<section>
    <h2>What is Nature?</h2>
    <p>
        Nature includes everything around us such as trees, rivers, mountains, animals, air, and water.
        It provides us with food, shelter, oxygen, and resources necessary for survival.
    </p>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>Importance of Nature</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Provides oxygen and clean air</li>
        <li>Maintains ecological balance</li>
        <li>Source of food and medicine</li>
        <li>Supports wildlife and biodiversity</li>
    </ul>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>Ways to Save Nature</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Plant more trees</li>
        <li>Reduce plastic usage</li>
        <li>Save water and electricity</li>
        <li>Recycle and reuse materials</li>
    </ul>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>Precautions to Protect the Environment</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Do not litter</li>
        <li>Avoid cutting trees</li>
        <li>Use public transport</li>
        <li>Spread awareness among others</li>
    </ul>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>Images of Nature</h2>
    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1501785888041-af3ef285b470" alt="Forest">
    <p>Beautiful Green Forest</p>

    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507525428034-b723cf961d3e" alt="Ocean">
    <p>Clean Blue Ocean</p>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>Slogans & Quotes</h2>
    <p class="quote">"Save Nature, Save Future."</p>
    <p class="quote">"Earth is our home, protect it."</p>
    <p class="quote">"Go Green, Keep it Clean."</p>
</section>

<footer>
    <p>Created for Environmental Awareness Project</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
